  "ruleText": "PART Agr 911 CERTIFICATION OF ORGANICALLY PRODUCED PLANT, ANIMAL, FOOD OR FIBER COMMODITIES - EXPIRED\n\nSource. #7838, eff 2-27-03, EXPIRED: 3-27-11\n\nNew. #9988, INTERIM, eff 9-8-11, EXPIRED: 3-6-12\n\nNew. #10167, eff 8-3-12\n\nAPPENDIX I\n\nAPPENDIX II\n\nRule | Material Incorporated | How Materials May Be Obtained\n\nAgr 903.04 | United States Standards for Grades of Extracted Honey, U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Marketing Service, AMS 52, effective May 23, 1985. | https://www.ams.usda.gov/grades-standards/extracted-honey-grades-and-standards. The document is available to the public on the website at no cost.\n\nAgr 905.02-905.03 | United States Standards, Grades and Weights Classes for Shell Eggs, U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Marketing Service, AMS 56, effective July 20, 2000. | https://www.ams.usda.gov/grades-standards/shell-egg-grades-and-standardsThe document is available to the public on the website at no cost.\n\nAgr 908.07(a)(1) | New Hampshire Native Lumber Law-Study Booklet, issued by University of New Hampshire Cooperative Extension, 2016 edition. | https://extension.unh.edu/sites/default/files/migrated_unmanaged_files/Resource003216_Rep4656.pdf The document is available to the public on the website at no cost.",
